A member function parameter that is a POINTER TO FUNCTION whose parameter
list expands the class's pack (`fn(R (*g)(A...))' of fn<R(A...)>) kept a
raw frontend_pointer for a reference pack element (A = hard&), so the
constructor took `void (*)(<<type:frontend_pointer>>)' and no argument
matched (goto-symex's with_solver_hardness(std::function<void(T &)>).
